      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 25 monthly folds (Oct 2024 - Oct 2026); the first needs a full year of history so the\n  seasonal baseline has seen every season once\n- in every fold, all four models (persistence, climatology, majority class, LightGBM) are\n  refitted from scratch on the training data only - no future data, no shuffling\n- scores (Brier, MAE, RMSE, skill) are computed over all test months together;\n  the model with the best score is retrained on all data and served",
      "originalText": "- 25 monthly folds (Oct 2024 - Oct 2026); the first needs a full year of history so the\n  seasonal baseline has seen every season once\n- in every fold, all four models (persistence, climatology, majority class, LightGBM) are\n  refitted from scratch on the training data only - no future data, no shuffling\n- scores (Brier, MAE, RMSE, skill) are computed over all test months together;\n  the model with the best score is retrained on all data and served",
